side of his body, causing him to have one shriveled arm that he mostly
lets dangle and a gimpy leg that he drags as he shambles about. One
side of his face looks like an old human man, while the other is dark
and leathery with a dead eye. Cyrus spends his days simply scouring for
food and talking to himself, constantly giggling as he drags limbs of
rotting zombie flesh (sometimes still moving), and fragments of old bone
back to his stewing cauldron.
